[{"answer":"I am the middle child of the family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it is nice in some ways.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I have an older sister from whom I can borrow clothes from, if she lets me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I get to meet my older sister's friends,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/4.mp3"},{"answer":"although sometimes they think that I am too young to be with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a younger brother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/6.mp3"},{"answer":"He is cute, but sometimes I have to baby-sit him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/7.mp3"},{"answer":"There are good things and bad things about being the middle child.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/8.mp3"},{"answer":"My sister is the eldest child.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/9.mp3"},{"answer":"She was the first child, so she spent time alone with my parents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/10.mp3"},{"answer":"She got lots of attention when she was first born.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/11.mp3"},{"answer":"They took lots and lots of pictures of her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/12.mp3"},{"answer":"All her clothes and toys were brand new.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I got her hand-me-downs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/14.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents were the strictest with her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/15.mp3"},{"answer":"They had lots of rules for her to follow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/16.mp3"},{"answer":"She is the first child, so they want her to be perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/17.mp3"},{"answer":"My younger brother is the baby of the family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that we all spoil him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We let him get away with some things that he shouldn't get away with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/20.mp3"},{"answer":"His room is always messy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and my mother never gets mad about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/22.mp3"},{"answer":"She gets upset with me if my room is messy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/23.mp3"},{"answer":"She tells me that I'm old enough to keep a nice clean room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It's no good thinking about which position you would like to hold in the family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/25.mp3"},{"answer":"You really don't have a choice about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I like being the middle child.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I can relate to my older sister and my younger brother.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think the middle is probably a good place to be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/162-the-middle-child-2019-04-07-04-34-45/29.mp3"}]
